{
 "episode": 4,
 "duration_sec": 142.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "E4_L0",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "But nobody learns my name until the gala.",
   "scene_id": 1,
   "is_recap": true,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L1",
   "start": 4.0,
   "end": 6.0,
   "type": "scene",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "INT. GRAND ORIENT HOTEL - GALA BALLROOM - NIGHT",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L2",
   "start": 6.0,
   "end": 11.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "A banner reads \"Mehta Group x Rao Shipping - Investors' Gala\". Cameras flash.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L3",
   "start": 11.0,
   "end": 17.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Leela Mehta, dripping in emeralds, greets investors. Arjun and Tanya stand beside her, arm in arm.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L4",
   "start": 17.0,
   "end": 21.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mira enters in a midnight-blue gown. Heads turn.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L5",
   "start": 21.0,
   "end": 26.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MRS. MEHTA",
   "text": "Look who crawled in. Did they hire you to serve the drinks?",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L6",
   "start": 26.0,
   "end": 29.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Guests laugh. A waiter freezes with a tray.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L7",
   "start": 29.0,
   "end": 35.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Leela takes a glass of red wine from the tray and pours it slowly down the front of Mira's gown.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L8",
   "start": 35.0,
   "end": 39.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "LEELA",
   "text": "There. Now you look like you belong in the kitchen.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L9",
   "start": 39.0,
   "end": 42.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Tanya films it on her phone, giggling.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L10",
   "start": 42.0,
   "end": 46.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "TANYA",
   "text": "This is going straight to the office group chat.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L11",
   "start": 46.0,
   "end": 51.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mira doesn't move. She takes a napkin and calmly dabs her dress.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L12",
   "start": 51.0,
   "end": 57.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "You should save that video, Tanya. You'll want to remember tonight.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L13",
   "start": 57.0,
   "end": 60.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Arjun taps a glass. The room quiets.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L14",
   "start": 60.0,
   "end": 66.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "ARJUN MEHTA",
   "text": "Before the investors arrive, I have an announcement. Tanya and I are engaged.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L15",
   "start": 66.0,
   "end": 71.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Applause. Tanya holds up her hand. On it is Mira's engagement ring.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L16",
   "start": 71.0,
   "end": 73.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "That's my ring.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L17",
   "start": 73.0,
   "end": 76.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "ARJUN",
   "text": "It's my ring. I paid for it.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L18",
   "start": 76.0,
   "end": 81.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA",
   "text": "(smiling) Congratulations. Enjoy it while it lasts.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L19",
   "start": 81.0,
   "end": 87.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "The lights dim. A spotlight hits the stage. Harish Desai steps up to the microphone.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L20",
   "start": 87.0,
   "end": 96.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "DESAI",
   "text": "Good evening. As you know, the late Vikram Rao owned sixty percent of Rao Shipping and was the Mehta Group's largest investor.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L21",
   "start": 96.0,
   "end": 103.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "DESAI",
   "text": "His will named a single heir. Tonight, that heir takes his seat as chair of the board.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L22",
   "start": 103.0,
   "end": 107.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Leela straightens her necklace, smiling, sure it's about the Mehta family.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L23",
   "start": 107.0,
   "end": 111.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "DESAI",
   "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, Miss Mira Rao.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L24",
   "start": 111.0,
   "end": 114.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "The spotlight swings to Mira in her wine-stained gown.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L25",
   "start": 114.0,
   "end": 117.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Leela's champagne glass slips from her hand and shatters.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L26",
   "start": 117.0,
   "end": 120.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "ARJUN",
   "text": "Mira... Rao?",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L27",
   "start": 120.0,
   "end": 124.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Mira walks to the stage. The crowd parts.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L28",
   "start": 124.0,
   "end": 130.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA RAO",
   "text": "Thank you, Mr. Desai. My father's company has many partners.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L29",
   "start": 130.0,
   "end": 136.0,
   "type": "dialogue",
   "speaker": "MIRA RAO",
   "text": "And my first decision as chair... is about the Mehta Group.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L30",
   "start": 136.0,
   "end": 140.0,
   "type": "action",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "Leela grips Arjun's arm. Tanya lowers her phone.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  },
  {
   "id": "E4_L31",
   "start": 140.0,
   "end": 142.0,
   "type": "direction",
   "speaker": null,
   "text": "CUT TO BLACK.",
   "scene_id": 2,
   "is_recap": false,
   "estimated_time": false
  }
